"entity": {
"name": "OPmobility",
"description": "OPmobility SE engages in the manufacturing and sale of automotive components and environmental products and services. It operates through the following segments: Exterior & Lighting, Modules and Powertrain. The Exterior & Lighting segment engages in the development and production of exterior parts and lighting systems. The Modules segment is involved in the development, assembly and logistics of front-end modules and extends its product offering to other parts of the vehicles. The Powertrain segment developing on-board energy storage and pollution control systems through its C-Power business group, contributing to the development of cleaner mobility. The company was founded on April 15, 1946 and is headquartered in Levallois-Perret, France.",
